\title{SpatialData.plot: SpatialData visualization}
\description{
Visualization suit for 'spatialdataR'. Current functionality includes handling of multiscale 'images', visualizing 'labels', 'points', and 'shapes'. For the latter, POINT, POLYGON, and MULTIPOLYGON geometries are supported. For all but 'images', there is support to pass information from annotation 'tables' as aesthetics (e.g., 'colData' or 'assay' data).
